WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,081 --> 00:00:03,462
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,512 --> 00:00:05,886
This is Episode 46.

3
00:00:05,936 --> 00:00:08,341
Maya has a lemonade stand.

4
00:00:08,391 --> 00:00:10,742
A muddy blob rolls right up.

5
00:00:10,792 --> 00:00:12,120
Splash!

6
00:00:12,170 --> 00:00:13,753
Mud everywhere.

7
00:00:13,803 --> 00:00:15,034
Oh no!

8
00:00:15,084 --> 00:00:17,084
Here comes the sieve gate.

9
00:00:17,134 --> 00:00:18,652
A little wall.

10
00:00:18,702 --> 00:00:20,168
A little gate.

11
00:00:20,218 --> 00:00:21,941
Friends float up.

12
00:00:21,991 --> 00:00:23,660
The gate opens.

13
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:24,920
Come in!

14
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:26,852
The blob charges.

15
00:00:26,902 --> 00:00:28,528
The gate shuts.

16
00:00:28,578 --> 00:00:29,788
Bounce!

17
00:00:29,838 --> 00:00:31,090
Splat!

18
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:33,226
The blob puts on a hat.

19
00:00:33,276 --> 00:00:34,539
Sneaky.

20
00:00:34,589 --> 00:00:36,556
The gate is not fooled.

21
00:00:36,606 --> 00:00:38,083
Still shut.

22
00:00:38,133 --> 00:00:40,634
The blob tries one more time.

23
00:00:40,684 --> 00:00:41,745
Nope!

24
00:00:41,795 --> 00:00:43,388
Friends get in.

25
00:00:43,438 --> 00:00:45,086
Mud stays out.

26
00:00:45,136 --> 00:00:46,986
Every single time.

27
00:00:47,036 --> 00:00:48,951
That is the sieve gate.

28
00:00:49,001 --> 00:00:51,886
It checks who is knocking before they get in.

29
00:00:51,936 --> 00:00:54,182
Now you know WAF!

30
00:00:54,232 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
